### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:HeavyRainAndFog ;
    ex:hasRoadMarking ex:DoubleYellowLines ;
    ex:hasRoadMarking ex:WhiteArrowStraightAhead ;
    ex:hasTrafficLight ex:ObscuredTrafficLight .

ex:EgoVehicle a ex:AutonomousVehicle ;
    ex:isApproaching ex:Intersection ;
    ex:hasVisibilityReducedBy ex:HeavyRainAndFog .

ex:Pedestrian1 a ex:Pedestrian ;
    ex:isCrossing ex:Crosswalk ;
    ex:hasTrajectory ex:LeftToRight ;
    ex:hasClothing ex:YellowJacket .

ex:Pedestrian2 a ex:Pedestrian ;
    ex:isCrossing ex:Crosswalk ;
    ex:hasTrajectory ex:LeftToRight ;
    ex:hasClothing ex:DarkJacket .

ex:Bus a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isStationaryOrSlowMoving ;
    ex:isLocatedOn ex:RightSideOfRoad .

ex:HeavyRainAndFog a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:reducesVisibilityTo ex:Low .

ex:ObscuredTrafficLight a ex:TrafficLight ;
    ex:isNotVisibleDueTo ex:HeavyRainAndFog .
```

